/-!
# Joint analyticity of Carlson's single integral

The joint analyticity theorem is developed in `Carlson.R.SingleIntegral.Analytic`, before
its node-only specialization and the unit-interval representation. This module retains
the existing import path and exports both results.

## Main results

This module re-exports the following developments:

* `Carlson.R.SingleIntegral.UnitInterval`: The unit-interval representation and node
  analyticity.

## References

* B. C. Carlson, *Special Functions of Applied Mathematics*, Academic Press, 1977.
-/
